We start with initial state: vehicles available, route_task_profile_alpha available, operator available, cargo available, origin_availability_node_linked and destination_availability_node_linked already true for both availabilities to their nodes. transport_leg_alpha available, loading_containers alpha and beta available, candidate_origin_availability_linked for both shift candidates to origin_availability_alpha, candidate_destination_availability_linked for both shift candidates to destination_availability_alpha, candidate_transport_leg_linked for both shift candidates to transport_leg_alpha, candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha, shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta. equipment resources available, service windows available, dispatch_slot_alpha available, skill_certificate_alpha available, operational_constraint_alpha available, candidate_operational_constraint_linked shift_candidate_alpha operational_constraint_alpha and shift_candidate_beta operational_constraint_beta, compliance_certificate_alpha available.

