Now we need to consider the many steps. Let's attempt to construct a minimal plan.

We have two main tracks: dispatch shift_candidate_alpha (schedule_candidate) and dispatch origin_availability_alpha (origin_candidate_availability). Also need to create shift_candidate_beta (just create_candidate). Also need to keep compliance_certificate available and route_task_profile available at end.

